<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 3COM raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 3COM raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co said analyst Paul Johnson raised his rating on shares of computer networking hardware maker 3Com Corp to buy from market performer based on increasing investor expectations and indications of improving business trends.</p>
<p>-- in a statement, Johnson said &quot;business appears to be getting better in the networking industry.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said recent trends at 3Com confirm his view that the second half of 1997 would be stronger than the first half.</p>
<p>-- 3Com shares were up 2-1/4 to 49 by mid-morning.</p>
</text>
